-- THE STEPWISE CONJUGATION (the *-involution the twisted arrow `bar` requires): flip the chirality bit at each
-- step. On F₂ the flip is `𝟙 +F _`, and it IS an involution: 𝟙 +F (𝟙 +F b) ≡ b (F₂: x ⊕ x = 𝟘).
f2-flip : F₂ → F₂
f2-flip b = 𝟙 +F b
